(text "Tiny edge pad1 = VSYS: its USB VBUS reaches this pad through onboard B5819WS diode.\nCarrier battery D1 ORs here. Tiny onboard ME6217 supplies 3V3_D from edge pad3.\nNo second digital regulator; no parallel 3.3V regulator outputs. No charger.\nStart with USB only or battery only. USB adapter/FPC are required for download and wired data." (at 25 109 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid "38754e21-bc03-5d9a-8473-8a90ce1c0988"))
